Error: Jet.GrammarUndefinedRule: `word` names no rule
  --> Tests/UI/grammar_undefined_rule.jet:5:31
    |
  5 |     pair : key=WORD '=' value=word ;
    |                               ^
 Why: Each name an alternative uses must be a rule the parser can take, defined in this grammar or in a grammar it imports
 Fix: Define `word : … ;`, or import the grammar that defines it
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.GrammarUndefinedRule
